4b810f63a9866.webm?t=1792951582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>No rush and no stress. It's just you, your tools and a mess waiting to be transformed into something perfect. <br>Fully enjoy the satisfying feeling of cleaning.<br>If you want a challenge, aim for the leaderboard by finishing jobs with maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/6061655d737e2db4056eccdc14a4cf68.webp?t=1792951582\" width=339 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/75688c723a86e19361a0119f9fa6c074.poster.avif?t=1792951582\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/75688c723a86e19361a0119f9fa6c074.webm?t=1792951582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Each job tells its own story. Clean unique locations and experience their atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/052556a95f623dd6ecdd2b482fe5e75d.webp?t=1792951582\" width=339 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/da6b949122102e7baf7b44a97d44cd09.poster.avif?t=1792951582\" width=1170 height=457 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413190/extras/da6b949122102e7baf7b44a97d44cd09.webm?t=1792951582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></s